{arial}From {arialbld}Weston Lacoline{arial}
Acting Prime Minister
Government of Normo Democratic Nations


Dear {rank} {name}.

I have the great pleasure of informing you of Parliament's unanimous decision: Yours is the honour to represent the Normo nation at the ceremony of Katzarin's unconditional surrender.{pause}

The treaty will be signed on the Schyzo aircraft carrier {arialbld}"Vandaume"{arial}, in the presence of General Tyron Spirex for the Federation of Schyzo States and Commander Mayumi Bazuka for Nikondo.{pause}

{ia13}{offset110}
{arialbld}Marshall Sakharin,{arial} the new strongman of Katzarin, will sign the Parano surrender. Pragmatic and respected, he holds the hopes of the Katzar people for reforming the Katzar-Khat's despotic hegemony.{pause}{offset0}







{ia2}{offset95}{ia17}{offset205}{ia11}{offset0}














{arialbld}Kharkan{arial} and {arialbld}Yorik{arial} are assumed to be dead. Unfortunately the remains of their bodies could not be found. For {arialbld}Nikloz{arial} only a green, nauseous mush was found in the rubble of his laboratory. 

{ia3}{jail}{offset110}
{arialbld}Natkrof{arial} was captured while trying to escape on a submarine before the end of the combat. He's presently awaiting trial for "complicity in attempt of mass poisoning conspiracy".{pause}{offset0}








The Emperor Tagamoshi has decided to achieve his utopia of making Nikondo a democracy. He will solely exercise the role of Supreme Judge, guarantor of equitable justice for all. All Fanato citizens will be eligible to vote, including women!{pause}

{ia9}{offset105}His daughter, the Princess Mayumi, from the top of her 22 years, has turned to politics! She has just started her own party, the {arialbld}"SHIN-NAMI"{arial}: "the wave of renewal".{pause}
Elevated by her campaign's exploits to the dignity of Eternal Heroine, she is regarded as the favourite for the next Nikonese election. However, thinking of a woman prime minister in Nikondo would be a tough thing to swallow for the ultra-conservatives.{pause}{offset0}



{ia8}{offset110}As for Tyron Spirex, he's already campaigning for the presidency of the Schyzo States. He's not losing any opportunities for shaking hands and media photo-ops. His campaign slogan is {arialbld}"A TSUNAMI plan for the States"{arial}. He's also taking advantage of the campaign to promote his latest book: "The Tsunami strategy".
It seems that Clarissa Audrey Jackson is in no hurry to attend his triumphal return to the Schyzo capital.{pause}{offset0}





A final word {name}{pause}

By order of Her Majesty the Queen of Normos, Gloria Magna Regina, Eleanor the Fourth, you are decorated with the Star of Permanent Honour.


Congratulations.{pause}


{offset100}{arialbld}Weston Lacoline{arial}



